stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Negotiating
  Negotiating --> Unlocked : AP2 not in intersection
  Negotiating --> SecurityLocked : ap2_mandate in intersection
  Unlocked --> TrustedUI : buyer places order in trusted UI
  TrustedUI --> [*]
  SecurityLocked --> SignedCheckout : business adds ap2.merchant_authorization
  SignedCheckout --> Rejected : platform cannot verify signature
  SignedCheckout --> MandateSigned : buyer consents, checkout_mandate signed
  MandateSigned --> Rejected : mandate missing, expired or wrong scope
  MandateSigned --> Completed : business verifies, PSP verifies payment mandate
  Completed --> [*]
  Rejected --> [*]
  note right of SecurityLocked
    No downgrade to an unprotected
    checkout for this session
  end note
